{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe heat in Prague is becoming quite oppressive, but I have made the most of it. This morning I wandered through the galleries and churches, my eyes tired but my mind content. Yesterday we spent four hours at Karlstein; the old paintings there possess a dignity that modern works lack, a quietude that suits the spirit.\n\nWe are staying with my uncle’s family. They are charming, and this afternoon they drove us in a carriage to a pleasure ground outside the town. The air there is fresher, and I enjoyed the walk immensely. It is a relief to escape the dust of the city streets for a few hours. I dine with them again tomorrow, which will give me a proper break from my own lodgings.\n\nI think of you and the boys often. The journey is tiring, but the company is good. I shall write again from Vienna.\n\nYours ever,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080478,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":193,"prompt_tokens":940,"total_tokens":1133,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-qMkh5gSwvxTSXJfLR7BveBGg1fMpahGI","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":940,"prompt_ms":938.316,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9982085106382979,"prompt_per_second":1001.7947045558212,"predicted_n":193,"predicted_ms":4682.768,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.389416666666666,"predicted_per_second":41.00139063049889}}